    'legal.privacy_cookies_text': 'This website does not use cookies. We do not set any first-party or third-party cookies. The only client-side storage used is localStorage to remember your theme preference (light/dark mode), which is classified as strictly necessary under the ePrivacy Directive and does not require consent.',
    'legal.privacy_analytics_title': 'Analytics',
    'legal.privacy_analytics_text': 'We use Cloudflare Web Analytics and Microsoft Clarity. Cloudflare Web Analytics is a privacy-first service that does not use cookies, does not collect personal data, and does not track individual users. It provides aggregated statistics such as page views, referrers, and geographic regions. Microsoft Clarity records anonymized user interactions (clicks, scrolls, navigation) to help us improve usability. Clarity automatically masks sensitive content, does not collect personal data, and does not use cookies for cross-site tracking. No personally identifiable information is collected or stored by either service.',
    'legal.privacy_data_title': 'Data Processing',
    'legal.privacy_data_text': 'This website does not collect, store, or process any personal data. We do not have user accounts, login forms, contact forms, or any mechanism that collects personal information. The safety scores and data displayed are aggregated from public sources and do not contain personal data.',
    'legal.privacy_hosting_title': 'Hosting',
    'legal.privacy_hosting_text': 'This website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process technical data (such as IP addresses) as part of its infrastructure to serve web pages. This processing is governed by Cloudflare\'s privacy policy. We do not have access to individual visitor data.',
    'legal.privacy_rights_title': 'Your Rights',
    'legal.privacy_rights_text': 'As we do not collect personal data, there is no personal data to access, rectify, or delete. If you have any privacy-related questions, please contact us using the information below.',
    'legal.privacy_votes_title': 'Community votes',
    'legal.privacy_votes_text': 'When you submit a Community Sentiment calibration, we store a salted hash of your IP address for abuse prevention and duplicate-vote detection — we never store your raw IP address. Cloudflare Turnstile may run an anti-bot check when enabled. We also save a flag in your browser\'s localStorage so you are not asked to vote again for a country you already voted on; this is local device storage, not a cookie, and is consistent with our zero-cookie approach.',
    'legal.imprint_title': 'Site Operator (Imprint)',
    'legal.imprint_text': 'This website is operated by an individual based in Italy. For questions, concerns, or legal inquiries, please contact:',
    'legal.imprint_name': 'Operator: Riccardo Dominici',
    'legal.imprint_email': 'Email: Riccardo.Dominici1999@gmail.com',
